      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, it definitely captures the vibe. \n\nOne thing though—I just ran it through our internal tool and the \"depth score\" came back way lower than what we usually look for in these big expansion quests. It's giving us a pretty low word count score. \n\nI'm not saying you should just add filler, but can you expand on this? Give it more weight. Maybe elaborate more on the specific \"shadow\" or the \"old gods\" she's mentioning? I really need this to feel like a meaty, significant moment for the player, and having a low score makes the engine flag it as a \"short\" interaction. Try to add more detail and lore so the score reflects a more substantial quest intro.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
